<section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Your data, in your control.</h2><span class="badge">Private on this laptop</span></div><p class="muted">Create a passphrase-encrypted backup containing your database and personal documents. Plain database exports and daily snapshots contain database records only.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/settings/encrypted">Encrypted complete backup</a><a href="/insights#alerts">Notification preferences →</a></div><p class="footnote">Encrypted exports protect the backup file. The live database and uploaded files remain unencrypted on this laptop.</p></section><section class="card" id="rules"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Income allocation</h2><span class="badge">Applied to new income</span></div><p class="muted">Active percentages must total 100% or less. Any remainder goes to Unallocated. Choose an asset to deposit a share there instead of crediting its account. Clear a rule name to remove it. Previous income keeps its original split.</p>
